  ],
  "mcp_calls": "0 - no MCP GitHub tool was called, read or write. Every GitHub touch went through the REST proxy with GITHUB_TOKEN.",
  "api_writes": "2 - POST /repos/objectstack-ai/objectui/pulls (draft PR 9804, HTTP 201, one retry after an HTTP 415 that carried no body and wrote nothing: the first attempt omitted Content-Type) and POST /repos/objectstack-ai/objectui/issues/9568/comments (this report). Branch pushes went over git, not REST: one empty-branch probe push and one content push. PR body read back in full after creation and byte-compared against what was sent - line-for-line identical, both footers intact, session-URL form preserved.",
